; SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

; The API model (ApiIR) built from the declarations of a program and their
; `doc { … }` tails, the validation that keeps it honest, and the writers that
; turn it into artifacts. See PLAN_API_DOCS.md.
;
; The model names a LOGICAL module and no namespace: a namespace, package,
; assembly and directory are four different things and the targets disagree
; about how many of them there even are. Physical names belong to the platform
; emitter, not here.

Import "./RangerApiParam.rgr"
Import "./RangerApiMethod.rgr"
Import "./RangerApiField.rgr"
Import "./RangerApiClass.rgr"
Import "./RangerApiModel.rgr"
Import "./RangerApiBuilder.rgr"
Import "./RangerApiPackageWriter.rgr"
Import "./RangerApiArtifactWriter.rgr"
Import "./RangerDocCommentWriter.rgr"